---
// Benefits.astro
---
<section id="benefits" class="py-24 bg-white relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-0 w-[300px] h-[300px] bg-brand-indigo/6 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute top-0 right-1/4 w-[250px] h-[250px] bg-brand-cyan/6 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 w-[300px] h-[200px] bg-brand-coral/5 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">

    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 animate-on-scroll">
      <span class="badge-indigo mb-4 mx-auto">Why Apex Business Assets</span>
      <h3 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-midnight mb-6 mt-4">Built differently. Focused entirely on you.</h3>
      <p class="text-lg text-brand-slate">We are a boutique web agency — small by design, so every client gets our full attention and a website built specifically for their business.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

      {/* Differentiator 1 — No Templates */}
      <div class="card p-8 animate-on-scroll border-brand-indigo/20 hover:border-brand-indigo/50 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(79,70,229,0.15)] group relative overflow-hidden">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-indigo/5 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-brand-indigo/10 transition-colors duration-500"></div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-indigo/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-brand-indigo/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:bg-brand-indigo group-hover:text-white text-brand-indigo relative z-10">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 20l4-16m4 4l4 4-4 4M6 16l-4-4 4-4" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-midnight mb-3 relative z-10">Custom-Built, Not Templated</h4>
        <p class="text-brand-slate leading-relaxed relative z-10">
          We don't drag and drop a WordPress theme and call it done. Every website we build is coded specifically for your business, your audience, and your goals.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Differentiator 2 — Local SEO First */}
      <div class="card p-8 animate-on-scroll border-brand-cyan/20 hover:border-brand-cyan/50 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(6,182,212,0.15)] group relative overflow-hidden" style="animation-delay: 0.1s;">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-cyan/5 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-brand-cyan/10 transition-colors duration-500"></div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-cyan/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-brand-cyan/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:bg-brand-cyan group-hover:text-white text-brand-cyan relative z-10">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z" /><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-midnight mb-3 relative z-10">Local SEO Is Built In</h4>
        <p class="text-brand-slate leading-relaxed relative z-10">
          A beautiful website that no one finds is just an expensive hobby. We build every site with local search visibility in mind from day one — not as an afterthought.
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Differentiator 3 — Transparent & Simple */}
      <div class="card p-8 animate-on-scroll border-brand-coral/20 hover:border-brand-coral/50 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-[0_20px_40px_-15px_rgba(244,63,94,0.15)] group relative overflow-hidden" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-coral/5 rounded-full blur-2xl group-hover:bg-brand-coral/10 transition-colors duration-500"></div>
        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-brand-coral/10 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6 border border-brand-coral/20 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:bg-brand-coral group-hover:text-white text-brand-coral relative z-10">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z" /></svg>
        </div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-midnight mb-3 relative z-10">Simple, Transparent Process</h4>
        <p class="text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
          No jargon, no hidden fees, no lock-in contracts. We have one simple goal: deliver a website that genuinely helps your business, then keep it running for you.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
